category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libgmock-devel libgtest-devel
sdesc: "C++ Common Libraries (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Abseil is an open-source collection of C++ library code designed to augment
the C++ standard library. The Abseil library code is collected from Google's
own C++ code base, has been extensively tested and used in production, and is
the same code we depend on in our daily coding lives."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/abseil/abseil-cpp
license: Apache-2.0
